  "correct_answer": "8000",
  "solution": {
    "text": "CFSE  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>  of  <math><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>18000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/>CFSE  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>  of  <math><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>?</mo></math> <br/><br/>From formula,  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>18000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo><mn>8000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
